  "solution": "**Given:**\n\na + (1)/(a) = 7\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + 1/a) = P ; then\n\n(a² + 1/a²) = P² - 2\n\n(a3 + 1/a3) = P³ - 3P\n\na⁵ + (1)/(a⁵) = (a² + 1/a²) × (a³ + 1/a³) - (a + 1/a)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\na + (1/a) = 7\n\n⇒ (a2 + 1/a2) = (7)2 - 2 = 49 - 2 = 47\n\n⇒ (a3 + 1/a3) = (7)³ - (3 × 7) = 343 - 21 = 322\n\na⁵ + (1/a⁵) = (a2 + 1/a2) × (a3 + 1/a3) - (a + 1/a)\n\n⇒ 47 × 322 - 7\n\n⇒ 15134 - 7 = 15127\n\n** ∴ The correct answer is 15127.**",
